WEBVTT

00:00:05.260 --> 00:00:06.420
"'The long hair hanging over my face...

00:00:06.420 --> 00:00:07.490
"'The sound of splashing surf in my ears...

00:00:07.490 --> 00:00:09.960
"'Memories of a hot summer..."'

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:23.580
Just by your being there,

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:30.250
the world seems to sparkle.

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:33.920
At one point,

00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:40.260
l had given up on love.

00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:46.930
Just for you, God must have...

00:00:46.930 --> 00:00:53.610
...done a custom-made job.

00:00:53.610 --> 00:00:57.210
This body of mine...

00:00:57.210 --> 00:01:03.550
...is ascending to Heaven
along with carbonated bubbles.

00:01:03.550 --> 00:01:04.880
Wait!

00:01:04.880 --> 00:01:11.560
Baby, baby, my low tension baby,

00:01:11.560 --> 00:01:15.560
Come chasing after me...

00:01:15.560 --> 00:01:18.230
more and more!

00:01:18.230 --> 00:01:24.570
ln heavy, heavy rotation, baby,

00:01:24.570 --> 00:01:28.570
l'm totally...

00:01:28.570 --> 00:01:33.340
...crazy about you!

00:01:39.920 --> 00:01:40.420
I'm in love.

00:01:40.420 --> 00:01:48.430
"'Be sure to sit away from the TV
in a well-lit room when watching anime"'

00:01:48.430 --> 00:01:50.260
I'll be at City Hotel tomorrow.

00:01:50.260 --> 00:01:51.790
All right.

00:01:54.930 --> 00:01:56.490
Stupid!

00:02:11.550 --> 00:02:17.150
"'The Man Who Creates a Storm"'

00:02:21.430 --> 00:02:24.100
Hold it!

00:02:24.100 --> 00:02:28.000
Aren't you misunderstanding something?
There's nothing between Morika and me.

00:02:32.440 --> 00:02:35.170
Get away from me,
you oversexed two-timer!

00:02:38.110 --> 00:02:40.600
Cripes, Momo-chan!

00:02:49.790 --> 00:02:50.950
Huh?

00:02:52.460 --> 00:02:54.060
Dear Okayasu,

00:02:54.060 --> 00:02:58.590
Here's a new cell phone case.
Please use it.
Momo.

00:03:02.400 --> 00:03:06.270
Ow! Watch where you're going!

00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:13.410
Why'd Okayasu skip school today?

00:03:13.410 --> 00:03:14.640
Who knows.

00:03:17.080 --> 00:03:18.550
"'No messages"'

00:03:18.750 --> 00:03:26.090
Damn him! He didn't send any voice
or text messages! Why doesn't he call?

00:03:26.090 --> 00:03:31.100
The right thing to do when
you're caught like that is to apologize.

00:03:31.100 --> 00:03:34.770
Okayasu and that girl
still have feelings for each other.

00:03:34.770 --> 00:03:39.110
lf l'm not around,
they could get back together.

00:03:39.110 --> 00:03:40.900
Maybe Okayasu is...

00:03:43.780 --> 00:03:45.300
Adachi!

00:03:49.450 --> 00:03:51.790
No! l don't want that, Okayasu!

00:03:51.790 --> 00:03:54.460
You said you wanted to be with me!

00:03:54.460 --> 00:03:56.690
Don't go to that woman!

00:04:03.730 --> 00:04:07.400
Okayasu! You're in there,
aren't you? Open up! Okayasu!

00:04:07.400 --> 00:04:13.200
If you betray me, you'll regret it!
Do you hear me?! Okayasu!

00:04:20.410 --> 00:04:22.750
Did you want something?

00:04:22.750 --> 00:04:25.750
I- I'm sorry! I made a mistake!

00:04:25.750 --> 00:04:27.420
Momo-chan?

00:04:27.420 --> 00:04:29.420
Okayasu...

00:04:29.420 --> 00:04:31.090
Momo-chan...

00:04:31.090 --> 00:04:32.760
Ryo!

00:04:32.760 --> 00:04:35.760
I've wanted to see you!

00:04:35.760 --> 00:04:36.960
Morika...

00:04:39.100 --> 00:04:44.110
It's all your fault! I called and called,
and you wouldn't see me!

00:04:44.110 --> 00:04:46.230
It's all your fault that I...

00:04:47.440 --> 00:04:48.530
I...

00:04:55.780 --> 00:04:58.810
Come with me, Morika.
Let's talk in private.

00:05:00.720 --> 00:05:02.150
My older brother.

00:05:03.390 --> 00:05:07.390
And the one Morika wanted to see was him.

00:05:07.390 --> 00:05:10.000
Apparently, he's been
avoiding Morika lately,

00:05:10.000 --> 00:05:13.070
and she wanted me
to get them back together.

00:05:13.070 --> 00:05:16.740
Wait a minute... She just
used you then, Okayasu?

00:05:16.740 --> 00:05:17.400
Just like that.

00:05:17.400 --> 00:05:20.410
How mean!

00:05:20.410 --> 00:05:24.750
He was beaten up by some thugs last night,
and he's supposed to be resting.

00:05:24.750 --> 00:05:29.420
Isn't he silly? Desperately protecting
something like this.

00:05:29.420 --> 00:05:31.420
Give it back! When'd you get that?

00:05:31.420 --> 00:05:32.610
Here.

00:05:35.420 --> 00:05:37.090
Are you stupid?

00:05:37.090 --> 00:05:40.060
Well, I was so happy.

00:05:48.770 --> 00:05:51.440
l realized it only after
l thought l lost him.

00:05:51.440 --> 00:05:55.780
Okayasu, you're more precious
to me than anyone else.

00:05:55.780 --> 00:06:00.550
Well, knowing you, Momo-chan, I figured
you'd come around and make a big scene.

00:06:00.550 --> 00:06:02.050
I was right.

00:06:02.050 --> 00:06:06.050
You're hopelessly in love with me, huh?

00:06:06.050 --> 00:06:09.060
Maybe we could've gone to a hotel?

00:06:09.060 --> 00:06:10.320
Stupid!

00:06:13.390 --> 00:06:15.160
We've been seeing each other
for two months,

00:06:15.160 --> 00:06:18.070
so l've been giving it some thought.

00:06:18.070 --> 00:06:20.730
But how dare he think of going to a hotel?!

00:06:20.730 --> 00:06:22.070
Momo-chan...

00:06:22.070 --> 00:06:23.400
Hey, why?

00:06:23.400 --> 00:06:26.740
It's going to be a
memory of a lifetime for us!

00:06:26.740 --> 00:06:28.870
I want somewhere more romantic!

00:06:31.080 --> 00:06:33.080
Then you're not against it?

00:06:33.080 --> 00:06:37.080
If the time and place will be memorable,
you're okay with it?

00:06:37.080 --> 00:06:41.090
Awright! This weekend,
let's go away and make memories!

00:06:41.090 --> 00:06:43.420
Okay, leave it to me!

00:06:43.420 --> 00:06:45.020
Okayasu!

00:06:46.430 --> 00:06:48.990
What did l get myself into?!

00:06:53.430 --> 00:06:54.770
The older brother?

00:06:54.770 --> 00:06:58.040
Can I talk to you about Kairi?

00:06:58.040 --> 00:07:03.040
Oh, how boring! Going out
with Toji is so boring!

00:07:03.040 --> 00:07:05.840
And that girl is in love with Okayasu.

00:07:21.400 --> 00:07:23.730
I'm sorry about that scene earlier.

00:07:23.730 --> 00:07:25.070
Oh no...

00:07:25.070 --> 00:07:30.740
I've been so busy, I didn't
call Morika. It's my fault.

00:07:30.740 --> 00:07:33.410
You create video games?

00:07:33.410 --> 00:07:37.080
Yes. My deadline's coming up,
so I've been cooped up at work.

00:07:37.080 --> 00:07:39.710
And what's this about Okayasu?

00:07:45.750 --> 00:07:47.760
Do you know...

00:07:47.760 --> 00:07:51.430
...about Kairi and Morika's past?

00:07:51.430 --> 00:07:54.090
That they used to see each other?

00:07:54.090 --> 00:07:57.930
What did Kairi tell you?
About Morika and me?

00:08:00.370 --> 00:08:03.040
My brother stole her from me.

00:08:03.040 --> 00:08:04.370
Is what he told me...

00:08:04.370 --> 00:08:06.370
So that's what he believes.

00:08:06.370 --> 00:08:08.040
Is he wrong?

00:08:08.040 --> 00:08:13.710
Yes, he is. I guess I should
tell you what really happened.

00:08:13.710 --> 00:08:17.380
Morika was my girlfriend first.

00:08:17.380 --> 00:08:19.720
When Kairi began cutting classes,

00:08:19.720 --> 00:08:25.060
I asked Morika to tutor him,
and before I knew it, they were involved.

00:08:25.060 --> 00:08:27.530
Kairi was serious about her.

00:08:27.530 --> 00:08:32.400
But Morika pitted him against me
and was enjoying herself.

00:08:32.400 --> 00:08:36.070
I think it made her feel good
to have brothers fighting over her.

00:08:36.070 --> 00:08:42.080
However, when I tried to break off
with her, she dumped Kairi,

00:08:42.080 --> 00:08:46.750
and we got back together.
But Kairi couldn't handle it.

00:08:46.750 --> 00:08:48.420
That Morika!

00:08:48.420 --> 00:08:51.420
Why didn't you tell him the truth?

00:08:51.420 --> 00:08:54.760
If he learned that Morika
was just having fun with him,

00:08:54.760 --> 00:08:59.690
can you imagine his hurt? I just
couldn't bring myself to tell him.

00:08:59.690 --> 00:09:04.700
But Okayasu believes that
you stole Morika from him.

00:09:04.700 --> 00:09:08.040
As it is, you'll always be the villain!

00:09:08.040 --> 00:09:12.040
I don't care what Kairi thinks of me.

00:09:12.040 --> 00:09:16.380
That's why I ask that you don't
say anything about this to him.

00:09:16.380 --> 00:09:19.710
Lately, Kairi's been awfully cheerful.

00:09:19.710 --> 00:09:25.050
I was wondering why, but it's
because he started seeing you.

00:09:25.050 --> 00:09:29.060
After he started seeing you,
Kairi changed his life for the good.

00:09:29.060 --> 00:09:34.620
Momo-chan, please be good to Kairi.

00:09:37.400 --> 00:09:39.730
He's a nice brother.

00:09:39.730 --> 00:09:41.740
Momo-chan!

00:09:41.740 --> 00:09:44.200
Would you like the ocean?
Or the highlands?

00:09:44.200 --> 00:09:46.740
Bathing together at a
hot spring sounds great, too.

00:09:46.740 --> 00:09:48.410
Yes, yes.

00:09:48.410 --> 00:09:51.080
Hey, can't you be more enthusiastic?

00:09:51.080 --> 00:09:54.750
We have to pick the place together,
or it's meaningless.

00:09:54.750 --> 00:09:56.550
You're right, sorry.

00:09:57.750 --> 00:10:01.760
Oh, I saw your brother afterward yesterday.

00:10:01.760 --> 00:10:03.760
He's a nice brother.

00:10:03.760 --> 00:10:09.100
He's only nice on the outside. Who knows
what evil he's planning on the inside!

00:10:09.100 --> 00:10:13.430
Don't be fooled by him, Momo-chan.
He's a smooth talker.

00:10:13.430 --> 00:10:16.440
No, he can't be like that!

00:10:16.440 --> 00:10:21.440
Don't you believe me? He's like Sae-chan!

00:10:21.440 --> 00:10:25.780
He thrives on stealing things from people.
He's the male version of Sae!

00:10:25.780 --> 00:10:31.450
If he learned that Morika was just having
fun with him, can you imagine his hurt?

00:10:31.450 --> 00:10:36.450
Okayasu, I think you're biased because
your brother took Morika-san from you.

00:10:39.790 --> 00:10:42.690
Momo-chan, I thought you,
of all people, would understand.

00:10:47.800 --> 00:10:50.800
You don't even know
how your brother feels!

00:10:50.800 --> 00:10:53.400
Do you think you're the only one
who was hurt by this?

00:10:55.140 --> 00:10:56.670
Huh?

00:10:58.080 --> 00:11:01.610
This is the beach where we first met...

00:11:04.750 --> 00:11:08.850
How many travel agencies did he go to?

00:11:22.100 --> 00:11:22.770
Yes?

00:11:22.770 --> 00:11:25.110
Okayasu, it's me.

00:11:25.110 --> 00:11:28.780
I'm sorry about today. Are you still upset?

00:11:28.780 --> 00:11:29.780
No...

00:11:29.780 --> 00:11:31.780
Want to go somewhere tomorrow?

00:11:31.780 --> 00:11:32.780
Sure.

00:11:32.780 --> 00:11:34.450
Then, 10 o'clock.

00:11:34.450 --> 00:11:36.210
Uh-huh.

00:11:55.800 --> 00:11:59.070
Okayasu's still not here.

00:11:59.070 --> 00:12:00.370
Momo-chan...

00:12:02.410 --> 00:12:03.410
Hello.

00:12:03.410 --> 00:12:05.410
H- hello...

00:12:05.410 --> 00:12:08.750
Sorry, Kairi had some urgent business.

00:12:08.750 --> 00:12:12.420
Huh? Okayasu can't come?

00:12:12.420 --> 00:12:18.430
He could've called at least. Maybe he's
still mad at me about yesterday.

00:12:18.430 --> 00:12:19.760
I'm very sorry.

00:12:19.760 --> 00:12:22.430
Oh, you don't have to apologize.

00:12:22.430 --> 00:12:25.170
I didn't know your
cell phone number, Momo-chan,

00:12:25.170 --> 00:12:27.430
so I couldn't notify you
that Kairi couldn't come.

00:12:27.430 --> 00:12:31.100
So you came yourself?! I'm so sorry!

00:12:31.100 --> 00:12:34.780
No, I was coming this way anyway.
Don't worry.

00:12:34.780 --> 00:12:38.310
Okayasu, you fool! You have
such a kind brother.

00:12:38.310 --> 00:12:40.840
How dare you liken him to Sae!

00:12:43.780 --> 00:12:46.120
What'll you do now?

00:12:46.120 --> 00:12:48.820
I have a company party now.

00:12:48.820 --> 00:12:51.720
I'd like to make it up to you
for my brother. Will you join me?

00:12:54.800 --> 00:12:56.460
Geez...

00:12:56.460 --> 00:13:00.400
Hello? Kairi? I need a favor.

00:13:00.400 --> 00:13:01.920
Morika?

00:13:08.080 --> 00:13:11.080
Wow! So grand!

00:13:11.080 --> 00:13:14.410
I- I don't think I belong here.

00:13:14.410 --> 00:13:15.750
No such thing.

00:13:15.750 --> 00:13:17.310
But...

00:13:20.090 --> 00:13:21.280
Let's go.

00:13:25.760 --> 00:13:29.290
l've never been escorted by a man before.

00:13:30.430 --> 00:13:33.830
l have butterflies, but it feels sorta nice.

00:13:40.440 --> 00:13:41.780
Cheers!

00:13:41.780 --> 00:13:45.450
S- Sae! What're you doing here?!

00:13:45.450 --> 00:13:47.110
Oh, don't be concerned
about such petty things!

00:13:47.110 --> 00:13:48.120
Of course, I'm concerned!

00:13:48.120 --> 00:13:52.120
Hello! I'm Kashiwagi Sae,
a friend of Momo-chan's.

00:13:52.120 --> 00:13:55.790
Friend?! How can she
say that so nonchalantly?!

00:13:55.790 --> 00:13:58.730
What is your name?

00:13:58.730 --> 00:14:01.400
I'm Ryo Okayasu.

00:14:01.400 --> 00:14:03.400
Okayasu?!

00:14:03.400 --> 00:14:05.070
Huh? Okayasu-san?!

00:14:05.070 --> 00:14:07.120
Okayasu-san is here?!

00:14:09.400 --> 00:14:11.740
It's such an honor to meet you!

00:14:11.740 --> 00:14:13.740
I just love your games!

00:14:13.740 --> 00:14:16.740
I can't wait for your new one!
Please continue to do your best!

00:14:16.740 --> 00:14:21.080
Wow... he's really popular.

00:14:21.080 --> 00:14:23.080
Too bad, Sae.

00:14:23.080 --> 00:14:25.720
That's Okayasu's older brother.
If you try to get near him,

00:14:25.720 --> 00:14:28.420
you'll have to deal
with his kid brother, too.

00:14:28.420 --> 00:14:32.760
And you really hate Okayasu, don't you?
You don't even go near him.

00:14:32.760 --> 00:14:36.430
He and Bakayasu are different!

00:14:36.430 --> 00:14:38.770
Stupid Momo-chan!

00:14:38.770 --> 00:14:44.100
No way! That Sae... shed tears over a man?

00:14:44.100 --> 00:14:47.130
Nah... she can't be serious.

00:14:49.110 --> 00:14:53.770
You have Toji. lf you treat him badly,
l won't forgive you.

00:14:55.780 --> 00:14:58.050
Wow! It's so pretty!

00:14:58.050 --> 00:15:00.450
The mist feels so wonderful.

00:15:01.390 --> 00:15:04.790
Are you sure it's all right?
To sneak away like this?

00:15:04.790 --> 00:15:06.730
Won't your fans be disappointed?

00:15:06.730 --> 00:15:10.750
Don't worry. Besides, I prefer
to stay with you, Momo-chan.

00:15:13.400 --> 00:15:15.930
I feel so relaxed with you, Momo-chan.

00:15:21.070 --> 00:15:27.410
Oh, that's it. Momo-chan, you look
like someone I loved long ago.

00:15:27.410 --> 00:15:31.540
Hey, that's embarrassing.
What kind of person was she?

00:15:32.420 --> 00:15:35.760
She's no longer of this world.

00:15:35.760 --> 00:15:40.090
I thought we'd share
our lives together, but...

00:15:40.090 --> 00:15:41.090
I'm sorry.

00:15:41.090 --> 00:15:46.430
No, I'm happy. It's like
being with my lover again.

00:15:46.430 --> 00:15:49.770
You still love her, don't you?

00:15:49.770 --> 00:15:55.110
I can't forget her.
Because it's not like we broke up.

00:15:55.110 --> 00:15:59.380
I think that's why things
haven't worked out with Morika.

00:15:59.380 --> 00:16:03.110
Perhaps I can't love anyone ever again.

00:16:06.720 --> 00:16:10.390
Momo-chan... will you let me hold you?

00:16:10.390 --> 00:16:11.390
Huh?!

00:16:11.390 --> 00:16:16.990
Oh, what am I saying?! I'm sorry!

00:16:21.070 --> 00:16:22.830
It's all right.

00:16:26.070 --> 00:16:29.080
l was shocked at my words.

00:16:29.080 --> 00:16:32.750
But just this once...

00:16:32.750 --> 00:16:36.080
So he can hold his memories again.

00:16:36.080 --> 00:16:40.420
Ryo's at a party here.
Please tell him I'm here.

00:16:40.420 --> 00:16:42.760
What? Using me again?!

00:16:42.760 --> 00:16:46.090
You're the only one
I can rely on, Kairi! Please!

00:16:46.090 --> 00:16:47.120
Geez...

00:16:50.760 --> 00:16:53.320
l feel like a treasure being wrapped up.

00:16:54.430 --> 00:16:59.340
What kind of woman was it...
who was loved by such tender hands?

00:17:03.380 --> 00:17:04.740
Okayasu!

00:17:07.380 --> 00:17:09.720
No, this is!

00:17:09.720 --> 00:17:12.280
Ryo, why you!

00:17:15.720 --> 00:17:18.730
Stop! You've got it wrong!
It's not like you think!

00:17:18.730 --> 00:17:23.400
Don't you dare try to steal Momo-chan!
You always... always!

00:17:23.400 --> 00:17:26.400
Hold it... I understand.

00:17:26.400 --> 00:17:29.240
I didn't even think about your feelings...

00:17:29.240 --> 00:17:31.740
But seeing her brought back
so many memories...

00:17:31.740 --> 00:17:34.070
Huh? What're you talking about?!

00:17:34.070 --> 00:17:35.080
Hey...

00:17:35.080 --> 00:17:35.740
What?!

00:17:35.740 --> 00:17:37.140
Come with me.

00:17:40.080 --> 00:17:42.080
Don't kid around!

00:17:42.080 --> 00:17:43.310
Let's go!

00:17:50.760 --> 00:17:56.100
Wait, Okayasu! Didn't your brother
explain about earlier? He's...

00:17:56.100 --> 00:18:01.030
Don't ever fall for an invitation from
him again! Don't ever talk to him either!

00:18:01.030 --> 00:18:05.370
In fact, don't ever get close to him!
Keep a 10-meter distance from him!

00:18:05.370 --> 00:18:09.040
What are you saying?!
It's my business who I speak to!

00:18:09.040 --> 00:18:12.710
Just because we're seeing each other
doesn't mean you can control me!

00:18:12.710 --> 00:18:14.380
I admit I was wrong for letting myself

00:18:14.380 --> 00:18:16.050
get into a situation
that's easily misunderstood.

00:18:16.050 --> 00:18:19.050
But everything was innocent!

00:18:19.050 --> 00:18:23.050
Your brother didn't want me,
he wanted to embrace his dead lover!

00:18:24.390 --> 00:18:28.730
Besides, Okayasu, who are you to talk
after standing me up for our date?

00:18:28.730 --> 00:18:31.400
Date? What're you talking about?

00:18:31.400 --> 00:18:35.740
We spoke on the phone yesterday!
Don't you remember?

00:18:35.740 --> 00:18:37.400
It was Ryo!

00:18:37.400 --> 00:18:41.410
While I was away, he answered
my cell and pretended to be me!

00:18:41.410 --> 00:18:44.740
You're the pits! Blaming your brother!

00:18:44.740 --> 00:18:49.420
But I really don't know anything!
Momo-chan, you're being tricked by Ryo!

00:18:49.420 --> 00:18:53.420
As if! Why would your brother trick me?

00:18:53.420 --> 00:18:55.760
Okayasu, you don't know anything
about how your brother feels!

00:18:55.760 --> 00:18:57.690
That's why you say such things.

00:18:57.690 --> 00:19:01.700
Momo-chan! You believe him, but not me?!

00:19:01.700 --> 00:19:04.360
You're the one who
doesn't believe me, Okayasu!

00:19:04.360 --> 00:19:06.700
I do believe in you, Momo-chan!

00:19:06.700 --> 00:19:10.040
Then don't give me orders,
like stay away and don't talk to him.

00:19:10.040 --> 00:19:13.370
There's no way I'd get
involved with your brother!

00:19:13.370 --> 00:19:17.040
Even if you think that,
Momo-chan, he won't!

00:19:17.040 --> 00:19:22.810
I've told you from the start, to watch out
for Ryo! Why can't you understand that?!

00:19:28.720 --> 00:19:30.280
Forget it...

00:19:34.390 --> 00:19:41.130
Why? l don't want to fight with you.
You're the only one on my mind, Okayasu!

00:19:43.070 --> 00:19:47.440
lf he can't understand, l guess
l should tell him everything.

00:19:56.750 --> 00:19:57.750
Sae?

00:19:57.750 --> 00:20:00.590
It's true! Momo-chan is so shallow,

00:20:00.590 --> 00:20:04.420
she thinks nothing of
stealing another girl's boyfriend.

00:20:04.420 --> 00:20:07.090
She even stole my boyfriend.

00:20:07.090 --> 00:20:09.430
I always thought she was my friend.

00:20:09.430 --> 00:20:14.100
W- why you-! You're the
one who stole my boyfriend!

00:20:14.100 --> 00:20:15.100
Sae-chan...

00:20:15.100 --> 00:20:16.440
Yes?

00:20:16.440 --> 00:20:20.770
It's better not to speak ill
of others so readily.

00:20:20.770 --> 00:20:24.300
As far as I can judge,
Momo-chan's not that type of girl.

00:20:26.450 --> 00:20:30.780
I... I don't usually say such things...

00:20:30.780 --> 00:20:34.120
But it seemed like
Momo-chan was after you...

00:20:34.120 --> 00:20:37.110
So... 'bye!

00:20:40.790 --> 00:20:43.800
She said she was your friend.

00:20:43.800 --> 00:20:45.130
No, the exact opposite.

00:20:45.130 --> 00:20:48.130
I thought so.

00:20:48.130 --> 00:20:54.470
l'm so happy! He understands me so well.
He's Okayasu's brother, all right.

00:20:54.470 --> 00:20:55.480
Where's Kairi?

00:20:55.480 --> 00:21:01.780
I think I upset him. So I'm thinking
I should tell Okayasu the truth,

00:21:01.780 --> 00:21:02.750
and wanted to discuss it with you.

00:21:02.750 --> 00:21:05.750
I see... I guess it can't be helped.

00:21:05.750 --> 00:21:07.420
Well, I'll be going.

00:21:07.420 --> 00:21:11.090
Wait! I want to give you something.

00:21:11.090 --> 00:21:12.090
But...

00:21:12.090 --> 00:21:13.760
It won't take long.

00:21:13.760 --> 00:21:15.430
Kairi!

00:21:15.430 --> 00:21:18.770
If it's to do with my brother, forget it.

00:21:18.770 --> 00:21:24.430
I've looked all around for Ryo,
but I can't find him. Maybe he went home.

00:21:26.440 --> 00:21:27.770
He couldn't have!

00:21:27.770 --> 00:21:29.140
Huh? Kairi?

00:21:37.120 --> 00:21:38.790
Momo-chan...

00:21:38.790 --> 00:21:42.120
This is for all the worry we've caused you.

00:21:42.120 --> 00:21:44.920
Oh no... you don't have to do anything...

00:21:52.130 --> 00:21:54.800
Morika-san has one just like this.

00:21:54.800 --> 00:21:58.900
Oh yes... I gave it to her.

00:22:02.080 --> 00:22:04.980
You're so cute, Momo-chan...

00:22:06.750 --> 00:22:09.840
Such a waste to stay with Kairi.

00:22:10.750 --> 00:22:13.750
Oh no! l have to get away!
This is really bad!

00:22:13.750 --> 00:22:15.880
I- I'm going home!

00:22:22.430 --> 00:22:24.260
I won't let you.

00:22:26.100 --> 00:22:27.760
Okayasu!

00:22:36.970 --> 00:22:43.310
So much that l can't express it very well...

00:22:43.310 --> 00:22:52.650
so much that l can't believe it...

00:22:52.650 --> 00:22:55.650
l become so uneasy.

00:22:55.650 --> 00:23:02.590
l can't be all alone for so long.

00:23:02.590 --> 00:23:08.930
Where can we go

00:23:08.930 --> 00:23:18.280
where we can all be

00:23:18.280 --> 00:23:21.280
under the same sky?

00:23:21.280 --> 00:23:29.620
l'm sure that there will be stars there.

00:23:29.620 --> 00:23:35.960
No matter how hard things might be,

00:23:35.960 --> 00:23:42.630
there surely, surely is an answer.

00:23:42.630 --> 00:23:49.640
l just wish that l could be

00:23:49.640 --> 00:23:57.770
someone with that kind of courage.

00:24:00.580 --> 00:24:03.920
Stupid! Stupid! Stupid!
Just when l came to terms with it!

00:24:03.920 --> 00:24:07.590
No, something's wrong.
lt's not like Okayasu!

00:24:07.590 --> 00:24:12.260
Okayasu, my heart, which had
just begun to open... is in full bloom.

00:24:12.260 --> 00:24:15.250
Next on Peach Girl ''Who Will It Be?''
